@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+## Unreleased
+
+- Subcommands read their defaults from the `default_map` entry matching
+  their name, instead of receiving the parent's entire mapping. Previously
+  `default_map` values set for a subcommand were ignored.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
